  "weekly_summary": {
    "week": "2026-W41",
    "items": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "zh": "本周有三场RC，美国（1228人）、欧洲（1194人）、中美洲（184人），分别由蓝白吟颂、纯绿孳巢蜥、艾斯波云移席卷。其中两场最大的比赛：美国和欧洲都是两套相同套牌会师决赛。这两套牌也是在meta占比较高的套牌中表现相对不错的。",
          "en": "Three Regional Championships took place this week: the United States (1,228 players), Europe (1,194), and Central America (184). They were won by Azorius Chant, Mono-Green Broodscale, and Esper Blink, respectively. Both of the two largest events, in the United States and Europe, ended in mirror-match finals. These two strategies also performed relatively well among the decks with a sizable metagame share."
        },
        "deck_links": []
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "zh": "而相对没那么主流的套牌中，上周日本RC八强的红黑躁狂：表现相当出色（胜率56.7%）。红黑版本的暗光凤凰藤蔓操控人数不多，但拿下59%胜率，红蓝节奏（龙侯）也有57.6%。以上胜率均为本周三场RC合计。",
          "en": "Among the less mainstream strategies, Rakdos Delirium, which reached the Top 8 at last week's Japanese RC, performed particularly well with a 56.7% win rate. The Rakdos Darklight Phoenix Vengevine build had few pilots but posted a 59% win rate, while Izzet Tempo ([[card:Murktide Regent|Murktide Regent]]) reached 57.6%. These win rates combine all three RCs this week."
        },
        "deck_links": []
      },
      {
        "order": 3,
        "text": {
          "zh": "整体包括RC和MTGO在内，套牌构筑变化都不大。苏勒台版本的走骨也开始使用[[card:Seasoned Cryomancer|干练凛寒术士]]：deck:49b7aabbad6735868735；另外一套备牌带[[card:Marwyn, the Preserver|保育人玛雯]]的纯绿孳巢蜥席卷一场：deck:7d876faccf8981faca4c",
          "en": "Overall, deck construction changed little across the RCs and MTGO. Sultai Living End has also started using [[card:Seasoned Cryomancer|Seasoned Cryomancer]]: deck:49b7aabbad6735868735; a Mono-Green Broodscale list with [[card:Marwyn, the Preserver|Marwyn, the Preserver]] in the sideboard also won an event: deck:7d876faccf8981faca4c"
        },
